                        ],
                        "form": "пушкаря́х"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "bc27c222-f3ad-3edb-a9ee-9abf9b89a8d0",
                        "entry_id": "1a29735a-1f85-3353-9605-24981745580e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. то же, что артиллерист"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "81b53f79-de53-415d-a6af-2198460c9e44",
                                "sense_id": "bc27c222-f3ad-3edb-a9ee-9abf9b89a8d0",
                                "text": "Симский, исполняя устав чести, выдал им всех пленников, укрывавшихся в городе, и заплатил 100 рублей за освобождение князя Феодора Оболенского; но число литовцев и татар непрестанно умножалось под стенами, до самого того времени, как рязанский искусный пушкарь, немец Иордан, одним выстрелом положил их множество на месте: остальные в ужасе рассеялись."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "9a818e08-a9bd-3341-9376-1b827b5a19c8",
                        "entry_id": "1a29735a-1f85-3353-9605-24981745580e",
                        "glosses": [
                            "мастер по изготовлению пушек"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f245e2e6-9b1b-449a-9346-e0ad43dc1b5e",
                                "sense_id": "9a818e08-a9bd-3341-9376-1b827b5a19c8",
                                "text": "Там стоял отряд князя Дмитрия Михайловича Пожарского, к которому на помощь пришли жившие неподалеку пушкари ― мастера Пушечного двора."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "7e2a323a-d8c1-449f-aaba-de34c1c60a0d",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a29735a-1f85-3353-9605-24981745580e",
                        "source_sense_description": "артиллерист",
                        "target_lang_word": "cannoneer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "cannoneer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "3ea4ae29-206d-3345-9837-c5e49887a944",
                                        "entry_id": "b8962358-2558-3e7b-a378-2ccaedbec8b3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "An artillery soldier who maintains and operates (historical) a cannon, or (now) some other piece of heavy artillery."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "320e0503-1030-4614-a18b-a85edea1b095",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea4ae29-206d-3345-9837-c5e49887a944",
                                                "text": "Luckily, the cannoneer was only mildly injured when his cannon malfunctioned."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1afcd991-2d1c-465b-be42-52c7aa49b620",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea4ae29-206d-3345-9837-c5e49887a944",
                                                "text": "Then ſe the bringing of our ordinance / Along the trench into the battery, / VVhere vve vvil haue gabions of ſix foot broad / To ſaue our Cannoniers from muſket ſhot, […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5357f2b2-9532-4909-8673-a13bcf03ec53",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea4ae29-206d-3345-9837-c5e49887a944",
                                                "text": "The Irish cannoneers stood gallantly to their pieces till they were cut down to a man."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5f0530cd-04db-4839-8eee-7412dc6a2f45",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea4ae29-206d-3345-9837-c5e49887a944",
                                                "text": "Just as the spring came laughing through the strife / With all its gorgeous cheer; / In the bright April of historic life / Fell the great cannoneer."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28596fa3-b3d7-43bb-946f-e90d9579c54c",
                                                "sense_id": "3ea4ae29-206d-3345-9837-c5e49887a944",
                                                "text": "The American cannoneers, normally positioned well behind the front lines, found themselves unexpectedly thrust into a firefight. The cannoneers slammed shell after shell at the big German tanks, but the 105mm high-explosive rounds burst with little effect."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "30335ee9-2e43-4919-a743-a776f7b506d6",
                        "source_entry_id": "1a29735a-1f85-3353-9605-24981745580e",
                        "source_sense_description": "артиллерист",
                        "target_lang_word": "Kanonier",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Kanonier",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "44c00847-d1cb-3f49-aacc-c42331454b4f",
                                        "entry_id": "fbbc5e04-00a5-3a9a-b2a4-3b2db8eaed2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Soldat, der eine Kanone bedient"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "27071741-a3aa-463e-864e-4cc54f07face",
                                                "sense_id": "44c00847-d1cb-3f49-aacc-c42331454b4f",
                                                "text": "„Sigismund Ludwig Borkheim - Vom königlich-preußischen Kanonier zum Russland-Experten an der Seiten von Marx und Engels.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7becb0ad-d8b9-4bf4-8d35-d5607624304a",
                                                "sense_id": "44c00847-d1cb-3f49-aacc-c42331454b4f",
                                                "text": "„Eine ovale Photographie erklärte, daß es einmal einen jungen Kanonier Jepsen gegeben hatte, der neben einer leichten Haubitze kniete wie vor einem Altar, derselbe Kanonier trug in Galizien einen Mantel und sang mit anderen Kanonieren einen Weihnachtsbaum an.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "254ae1c2-5399-42d2-a334-d8953e768edc",
                                                "sense_id": "44c00847-d1cb-3f49-aacc-c42331454b4f",
                                                "text": "„Draußen auf dem See hatten wir uns eine Zielscheibe errichtet, an der wir regelmäßig übten, sodass wir ziemlich professionelle Kanoniere wurden.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b307398c-2e4e-4f8f-9fb4-bf058fa03b41",
                                                "sense_id": "44c00847-d1cb-3f49-aacc-c42331454b4f",
                                                "text": "„Den Alkohol tranken die Kanoniere auf der Stelle aus, was sie in heitere Stimmung versetzte.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "62c59f46-6239-4bd9-bf67-0d65f4432f67",
                                                "sense_id": "44c00847-d1cb-3f49-aacc-c42331454b4f",
                                                "text": "„Als er so glanzvoll an einem abgelegenen Feldgeschütz vorüberkam, überraschte er einen schnauzbärtigen Kanonier, der zwischen Bierflaschen und Schweinshaxen umsichtig Brotzeit machte.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fd4edc22-3f69-364e-a801-b86634352849",
                                        "entry_id": "fbbc5e04-00a5-3a9a-b2a4-3b2db8eaed2a",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "unterster Dienstgrad in der Artillerietruppe"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "Germany"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
